.TH NEO-CALENDAR 1 "2026-11-10" "gnome-phone 0.1.0" "GNOME Phone"
.SH NAME
neo-calendar \- calendar for GNOME Phone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neo-calendar
.SH DESCRIPTION
The Etar calendar rebuilt in GTK 4 on evolution-data-server: day, month and agenda views and the event editor. It is D-Bus activatable as neo.Calendar; an .ics file given on the command line opens in the editor as a new event.
.SH SEE ALSO
neo-calendar-reminders(1)
